{
    "title": "Voice Recorder - XVoice Lite",
    "description": "Audio Recorder is an easy to use and free app that helps you to record and store your recorded audio files in an intuitive user interface. Automatic silence detection helps you to skip silence intervals during voice recording and to reduce the size of audio files. You can also record a voice note and share a recording after each call. \r\nAlways be prepared to record with a Voice Recorder Lite.\r\n\r\nFull list of features include:\r\n\u2605 Audio recorder\r\n\u2605 Voice recorder\r\n\u2605 Easy access to calendar and email during calls - share your recordings with the one you are talking to!\r\n\u2605 Automatic Silence detection and skipping.\r\n\u2605 Voice recorder with manual silence sensitivity control.\r\n\u2605 Adjustable audio recording quality (8kHz \u2013 44kHz)\r\n\u2605 Save/Pause/Resume/Cancel voice recording control.\r\n\u2605 Background audio recorder with recording and playback controls in the notification bar.\r\n\u2605 Favorite audio recordings list.\r\n\u2605 Call share menu\r\n\u2605 Share a recorded voice via email and WhatsApp.\r\n\r\nThank you for using Voice Recorder - XVoice Lite",
    "descriptionHTML": "Audio Recorder is an easy to use and free app that helps you to record and store your recorded audio files in an intuitive user interface. Automatic silence detection helps you to skip silence intervals during voice recording and to reduce the size of audio files. You can also record a voice note and share a recording after each call. <br>Always be prepared to record with a Voice Recorder Lite.<br><br>Full list of features include:<br>\u2605 Audio recorder<br>\u2605 Voice recorder<br>\u2605 Easy access to calendar and email during calls - share your recordings with the one you are talking to!<br>\u2605 Automatic Silence detection and skipping.<br>\u2605 Voice recorder with manual silence sensitivity control.<br>\u2605 Adjustable audio recording quality (8kHz \u2013 44kHz)<br>\u2605 Save/Pause/Resume/Cancel voice recording control.<br>\u2605 Background audio recorder with recording and playback controls in the notification bar.<br>\u2605 Favorite audio recordings list.<br>\u2605 Call share menu<br>\u2605 Share a recorded voice via email and WhatsApp.<br><br>Thank you for using Voice Recorder - XVoice Lite",
